      "question": "Which subclinical specialty should primarily manage this case?",
      "my_answer": "Otolaryngology (ENT).",
      "rationale": "Otitis externa is a condition involving the external auditory canal, which falls under the domain of ENT. While primary care providers can manage uncomplicated cases, ENT is the definitive specialty for diagnosis and management, especially if complications arise or treatment fails."
    },
