      "question": "What diagnostic steps are necessary to confirm the diagnosis?",
      "my_answer": "Diagnosis is primarily clinical; no further diagnostics are needed initially.",
      "rationale": "The history and physical exam (tragal tenderness, auricular traction pain, canal edema, and erythema) are sufficient for diagnosis. Audiometry or imaging is not indicated unless treatment fails or complications develop."
    },
