      "question": "Which medical specialty should primarily manage this case?",
      "my_answer": "Neurology or Orthopedics",
      "rationale": "Neurology is appropriate for electrodiagnostic confirmation and non-surgical management; Orthopedics or Hand Surgery may be involved if surgical intervention becomes necessary. Primary care may initiate management, but specialty referral is indicated due to motor symptoms."
    },
